'''Luxray''' (Japanese: '''レントラー''' ''Rentorar'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

