==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crown Zenith|Luxray|44}} from the {{TCG|Crown Zenith}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Luxray|62}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Flash Impact''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Rising Rivals|Luxray GL LV.X|109}} from the {{TCG|Rising Rivals}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

